            "sid": "2SA 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaSawulu chanatiyiyi nawu Abineri nafwi kuHeberoni, azeya nikuzeya, aIsarela ejima azaaza nikuzaaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaSawulu wadiŋi nawantu ayedi adiŋi awakulumpi ayendu, wumu ijina dindi Bayana, mukwawu ijina dindi Rekabi, anyana kaRimoni wakuBeyeroti, wakudi anyana kaBenjamini; muloŋa Beyeroti nawa amufuukula dehi nawu waBenjamini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akwaBeyeroti atemukilili kuGitayimi, kwokwashakamawu nikulelu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonatani mwana kaSawulu wadiŋi namwanindi weyala wadiŋi chifwayi chanyendu. Hatiyiluwu nsaŋu jaSawulu naJonatani jafumini kuYezereyeli wadiŋi wanyaka yitanu, mukwakumulela hakumunyamuna, hakutemuka; mumbanda chanaswejiyi kutemuka lufuchi, mwana hakuholoka, hakwikala chifwayi. Ijina dindi Mefwibosheti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaRimoni wakuBeyeroti, aRekabi naBayana, hatatili nkanza hiyakuya, hiyakushika kwitala daIshibosheti hadiŋi nakunookayi hachayili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakwijila mukachi ketala neyi akukeŋa kunona tidiku, hiyakumutaŋa mwivumu; aRekabi namana kwindi Bayana hiyakupuluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa chashikiluwu mwitala amuweni nakami hakadidi kindi mwitala dindi dakukama, hiyakumutaŋa, hiyakumujaha, amuketula ninamutu, hiyakusenda namutu windi, hiyakwenda wufuku wejima njila yachana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakutwala namutu waIshibosheti kudi Davidi kuHeberoni, hiyakumwila mwanta, nawu, Tala namutu waIshibosheti mwana kachilumbu cheyi Sawulu iwu wakeŋeli kukujaha; Yehova namutendi dehi nkaka yami mwanta lelu kudi Sawulu nawanyanindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi hakwakula aRekabi namana kwindi Bayana, anyana kaRimoni wakuBeyeroti, hakuyila nindi, Chahandayi Yehova kwaamu, nakuuli wumi wami mukukala kwejima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chanlejeliyi muntulo inindi, Tiya, Sawulu wafwa dehi, yena watoŋojokeli nindi nanleteli nsaŋu yayiwahi, ami hinimukwata, hinimujahila kuZikilaŋi, wowu wufwetu namwinkeli nansaŋu yindi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "winzi wakamoni antu atama anajahi muntu waloŋa mwitala dindi yomweni hakadidi kindi, nibuli kwihula mashi indi kudenu, niyifumisha hanu hamaseki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi hakuleja anyikwenzi indi, hiyakuyijaha, hiyakuyiteta makasa nanyendu, hiyakuyikudika kwakwihi nejiya dakuHeberoni. Mutu waIshibosheti awutweli nakuwujiika mwŋamu daAbineri kwokuHeberoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
